<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ govt to keep eye on balance of payments-Peters.</title>
<headline>NZ govt to keep eye on balance of payments-Peters.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Balance of payment statistics for the September 1996 quarter showed there was no room for complacency over New Zealand's trade figures, Treasurer Winston Peters said on Monday.</p>
</text>
